<p>A <code>TourListItem</code> is a plain <code>&lt;li&gt;</code> that
  can carry <code>aria-current="step"</code> when it represents the
  user's current step. See the <a href="/components/tour/">Tour
  demo</a> for a composed example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;TourList label="Feature tour" active={showTour}&gt;
  &lt;TourListItem label="Search patients" current={step === 0} stepNumber={1} totalSteps={2}&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Type a patient name or NHS number into the search bar to find their record.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;button onclick={() =&gt; step++}&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/TourListItem&gt;
  &lt;TourListItem label="View results" current={step === 1} stepNumber={2} totalSteps={2}&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Click a result to open the full patient record.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;button onclick={() =&gt; step--}&gt;Back&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button onclick={() =&gt; showTour = false}&gt;Done&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/TourListItem&gt;
&lt;/TourList&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
{# END generated: examples #}
